---
import PhaseLayout from '../../layouts/PhaseLayout.astro';
---

<PhaseLayout
  title="Delivery"
  phase="foundation"
  description="Improving the pace of delivery by bringing in an Agile delivery model and the right processes."
>
  <div class="workstream-grid">

    <div class="ws-card now">
      <div class="ws-badge">NOW</div>
      <h3>Initial actions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Run a <strong>workshop with key stakeholders</strong> to map out the existing delivery process, identifying pain points and opportunities</li>
        <li>Work with the leadership team to identify and <strong>prioritise potential solutions</strong> to improve the delivery process</li>
        <li>Test ideas around improving the delivery process</li>
        <li>Potentially begin <strong>recruitment for a Technology Delivery Specialist</strong> role to own and continuously improve the delivery process</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="ws-card next">
      <div class="ws-badge">NEXT</div>
      <h3>Follow-on actions</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Onboard and begin coaching the new Technology Delivery Specialist role</li>
        <li>Begin introducing more elements of an <strong>Agile framework</strong> in partnership with the Technology Delivery Specialist role</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="ws-card placeholder">
      <div class="ws-badge placeholder-badge">WHAT HAPPENED</div>
      <h3>What actually happened</h3>
      <p><em>[Placeholder — add what was actually delivered on the delivery workstream, what changed from plan, and key decisions.]</em></p>
    </div>

    <div class="ws-card placeholder">
      <div class="ws-badge placeholder-badge">LESSONS</div>
      <h3>What was learned</h3>
      <p><em>[Placeholder — insights and reflections on improving delivery at ESco.]</em></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</PhaseLayout>

<style>
  .workstream-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .ws-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border-left: 5px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ws-card.now { border-left-color: var(--teal); }
  .ws-card.next { border-left-color: var(--purple-light); }
  .ws-card.placeholder { border-left-color: var(--border); background: var(--grey-bg); }
  .ws-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--teal-tint);
    color: var(--teal);
  }
  .ws-card.next .ws-badge { background: var(--purple-tint); color: var(--purple); }
  .placeholder-badge { background: var(--border) !important; color: var(--text-muted) !important; }
  .ws-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--purple-dark); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .ws-card ul { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .ws-card li { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .ws-card li strong { color: var(--text); }
  .ws-card p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>
